msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:13
msgid ""
"Invalid Image Settings cause provisioning failures. |morpheus| syncs in "
"as much meta-data as possible for synced images, but additional "
"configuration may be needed to ensure successful provisioning."
