#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:15
#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:110
#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:155
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Advertencia"

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:15
msgid ""
"Cloud-init is enabled by default for all Linux images. If your Linux "
"image does not have Cloud-init installed, `Cloud-init Enabled` must be "
"unchecked before provisioning the image or it will fail immediately."
msgstr ""
"Nube-init es habilitado/habilitada por predeterminado/predeterminada para"
" todos/todas Linux images. Si your Linux image does ningún tienen Nube-"
"init installed, `Nube-init Enabled` debe/n be unchecked antes de "
"provisioning el/la image o it será/n fail immediately."

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:18
msgid "Image Types"
msgstr "Image Types"

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:20
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides a vast *System Image* repo with pre-configured images"
" for every Cloud. All other images are *User Images*. User images can be "
"added directly to |morpheus|, or automatically synced from integrated "
"clouds. It is important to configure synced User Images for metadata, "
"including specifying the Platform and User Credentials, prior to "
"provisioning. Provisioning a User Image that has not been configured may "
"result in failed provisioning."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| provides a vast *System Image* repo with pre-configured images"
" for every Nube. All other images are *Usuario Images*. Usuario images "
"puede ser added directly to |morpheus|, or automatically synced from "
"integrated clouds. It is important to configure synced Usuario Images for"
" metadata, including specifying the Platform and Usuario Credentials, "
"prior to provisioning. Provisioning a Usuario Image that has not been "
"configured may result in failed provisioning."

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:22
msgid "Synced User Images need to be configured prior to provisioning."
msgstr "Synced Usuario Images need to be configured prior to provisioning."

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:25
msgid "Linked Clone Images"
msgstr "Imágenes de clon enlazado"

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:27
msgid ""
"A linked clone Virtual Image is a record backed by a snapshot of an "
"existing VMware or HVM/KVM VM. Provisioning from it creates a small "
"writable disk that shares the snapshot's base data, reducing deployment "
"time and initial storage consumption. It is not an independent copy of "
"the source disk."
msgstr "Una imagen virtual de clon enlazado es un registro respaldado por un snapshot de una VM existente de VMware o HVM/KVM. El aprovisionamiento a partir de ella crea un disco pequeño escribible que comparte los datos base del snapshot, reduciendo el tiempo de implementación y el consumo inicial de almacenamiento. No es una copia independiente del disco de origen."

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:29
msgid ""
"Linked clone images are created from an Instance's :guilabel:`Backups` "
"tab, not from the Virtual Images page. Prepare the guest, create a "
"snapshot, and select :guilabel:`More` > :guilabel:`Create Linked Clone` "
"for that snapshot. See the **Creating Linked Clone Images** section in "
":doc:`/infrastructure/storage/storage` for the complete workflow and "
"platform constraints."
msgstr "Las imágenes de clon enlazado se crean desde la pestaña :guilabel:`Backups` de una instancia, no desde la página Virtual Images. Prepare el guest, cree un snapshot y seleccione :guilabel:`More` > :guilabel:`Create Linked Clone` para ese snapshot. Consulte la sección **Creating Linked Clone Images** en :doc:`/infrastructure/storage/storage` para el flujo de trabajo completo y las restricciones de plataforma."

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:31
msgid ""
"After creation, edit the record in :menuselection:`Library --> Virtual "
"Images` and verify the inherited operating system, cloud-init or Sysprep,"
" guest customization, agent, credentials, and permissions. Keep the "
"source VM and backing snapshot for as long as the image or provisioned "
"linked-clone VMs are needed."
msgstr "Después de la creación, edite el registro en :menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images` y verifique el sistema operativo heredado, cloud-init o Sysprep, personalización del guest, agente, credenciales y permisos. Mantenga la VM de origen y el snapshot de respaldo mientras se necesite la imagen o las VMs de clon enlazado aprovisionadas."

